| `launcher.limited.niceness` | integer | `10` | a whole number, 1 to 19 | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `explain` | Sets the `os.nice` increment a long script on a shared host runs at when there is no farm, when it is local-only, and when the farm did not start it in time and the host is spare. It lowers the script's CPU priority only; it caps neither CPU nor memory. | a CPU or memory cap, which the stdlib cannot enforce | always |
